{"id":"n18661-2-7","stage":1,"title":"곳 · 处","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n18661-2-7-1","ko":"할머니, 어디 불편한 곳 있으세요?","zh":"奶奶，您哪里不舒服吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"할머니,","meaning":"奶奶，姥姥","explanation":"할머니：奶奶，姥姥。","readings":[{"term":"할머니","audio":"/audio/8dc4d6918deb0b6e1d10.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27375","senseId":"1","lemma":"할머니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"할머니","audio":"/audio/8dc4d6918deb0b6e1d10.mp3"}},{"text":"어디","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}},{"text":"불편한","meaning":"不舒服，不适","explanation":"불편하다：不舒服，不适；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"불편하다","audio":"/audio/e3a81c369f5e123fbec0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71049","senseId":"2","lemma":"불편하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"불편한","audio":"/audio/cf419b0e12de1ff822f6.mp3"}},{"text":"곳","meaning":"地方、部位","explanation":"곳：地方、部位；这里指身体哪里不舒服。","readings":[{"term":"곳","audio":"/audio/24875f860934407bb8fb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18661","senseId":"2","lemma":"곳","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"곳","audio":"/audio/24875f860934407bb8fb.mp3"}},{"text":"있으세요?","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；으세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있으세요","audio":"/audio/7d2bbaaa76284e5bcb4e.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8dc4d6918deb0b6e","term":"할머니","zh":"奶奶，姥姥","audio":"/audio/8dc4d6918deb0b6e1d10.mp3","entryId":"27375","definition":"用于指称或称呼父亲的母亲或母亲的母亲。","pronunciation":["할머니"]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代不知道的处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"e3a81c369f5e123f","term":"불편하다","zh":"不舒服，不适","audio":"/audio/e3a81c369f5e123fbec0.mp3","entryId":"71049","definition":"身体或心理欠佳，难受。","pronunciation":["불편하다"]},{"id":"24875f860934407b","term":"곳","zh":"地方、部位","audio":"/audio/24875f860934407bb8fb.mp3","entryId":"18661","definition":"具体的位置；本句指身体不舒服的部位。","pronunciation":["곧"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"事实或现象存在。","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/7948225e184037e8bf4f.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n18661-2-7-2","ko":"허리 쪽이 자꾸 아파.","zh":"腰这一带老是疼。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"허리","meaning":"腰","explanation":"허리：腰。","readings":[{"term":"허리","audio":"/audio/777cb8e22269860361d6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30201","senseId":"1","lemma":"허리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"허리","audio":"/audio/777cb8e22269860361d6.mp3"}},{"text":"쪽이","meaning":"这一带","explanation":"쪽：一侧、一带；-이 标记主语，指腰的部位。","readings":[{"term":"쪽","audio":"/audio/077b6c57af048c3baee6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58147","senseId":"1","lemma":"쪽","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"쪽이","audio":"/audio/713752120e43389e4ac4.mp3"}},{"text":"자꾸","meaning":"老是","explanation":"자꾸：反复、多次；在这里说腰部经常疼。","readings":[{"term":"자꾸","audio":"/audio/d28ff63a0382ce4fce6d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70796","senseId":"1","lemma":"자꾸","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자꾸","audio":"/audio/d28ff63a0382ce4fce6d.mp3"}},{"text":"아파.","meaning":"疼， 痛，不舒服","explanation":"아프다：疼， 痛，不舒服；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"아프다","audio":"/audio/912c6f176a189a346579.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62239","senseId":"1","lemma":"아프다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"